flowchart LR
    accTitle: Observe continuously, replan when needed
    accDescr: A reactive loop chooses actions from observations; a planning workflow checks evidence and revises its plan.
    Obs["Observation"] --> Act["Choose and execute action"]
    Act --> Obs
    Plan["Plan objectives"] --> Execute["Execute next step"]
    Execute --> Check["Check result and progress"]
    Check -->|Continue| Execute
    Check -->|Revise| Plan
    Check -->|Done or limit| Stop["Verify or escalate"]
